      "type": "section",
      "text": "ATMs > Bank Data Sharing Provider\n\nAccess to the ATM API requires the BDSP role. This role must be assigned to your application in the Trust Framework before calling the endpoint. See Roles for the full list of scopes and grant types this role permits. A single GET /atms call returns all ATMs published by an LFI. Each ATM record includes:",
