      "document_id": "tech/tpp-standards/v2.1/banking/atms",
      "type": "section",
      "text": "ATMs > Which LFIs are live with ATM data\n\nLFIs currently publishing ATM data across UAE Open Finance. Live data is currently unavailable. No LFIs are currently active for this capability.",
